{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1338812-bottomless-wellspring-approach","id":1338812,"title":"Bottomless Wellspring Approach?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-01T09:24:04-07:00","id":1338812,"title":"Bottomless Wellspring Approach?","content":"What, uh... what exactly does this charm do, besides the potential for extra successes? I've read the charm description, the attribute description, and the expanded Lore rules on introducing/challenging facts, and I honestly can't tell. The main benefit of the charm looks like it's &quot;roll to establish a fact whenever her knowledge...is challenged,&quot; but the Challenging a Fact section already says that I can make a reflexive roll &quot;any time the Storyteller introduces suspect information within notice of a character with an appro\u00adpriate Lore rating.&quot; It sounds like it <i>could </i>be overruling the restrictions on requiring a given Lore rating and/or specialty to challenge, but that doesn't make sense either-- Lore 3+ looks like it works universally, and the charm requires Lore 4.<br /> <br /> The only thing I can think of is that it's combing the Introduce and Challenge actions-- that when you succeed on your reflexive Lore roll, you not only know how the information is false, but you get to propose your own answer about what the truth is. Is that right, or am I missing something?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-01T10:40:05-07:00","id":1338835,"title":"","content":"I used to interpret that as meaning you could disregard the once per scene rule for Introduce a Fact, although that's probably not what's intended.<br /> <br /> I think it's really just about extra successes. I mean, this Charm is THE Introduce a fact charm, literally doubling all your successes and making &quot;world-shaking revelations&quot; completely routine for your character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-11T05:42:34-07:00","id":1340763,"title":"","content":"It doesn't really do anything significant. I just remove the charm from the charm tree...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-11T18:23:48-07:00","id":1340880,"title":"","content":"Harmonious academic methodology is so over powered and with two main effects. (The essence non charm auto successes vs the new lore specialty after every story). I feel like splitting that charm over two charms in the tree would work fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24967-general-trivia-kit","name":"General Trivia Kit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-11T20:20:32-07:00","id":1340895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grod_the_giant</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1338812-bottomless-wellspring-approach#post1338812\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What, uh... what exactly does this charm do, besides the potential for extra successes? I've read the charm description, the attribute description, and the expanded Lore rules on introducing/challenging facts, and I honestly can't tell. The main benefit of the charm looks like it's &quot;roll to establish a fact whenever her knowledge...is challenged,&quot; but the Challenging a Fact section already says that I can make a reflexive roll &quot;any time the Storyteller introduces suspect information within notice of a character with an appro*priate Lore rating.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>It is a little badly worded, but my reading is that having your knowledge, of topics covered by your Lore expertise, challenged is the condition required to <i>use the charm</i>. Also, the condition is not merely of encountering suspect information, it is of someone actively questioning the depth of your knowledge.<br /> <br /> The Lore roll you then make to introduce or challenge a fact then gains the bonus success (and doubles extra successes), so you can assert your qualifications.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/487-greyman","name":"Greyman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar487_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1308"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}